      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We visited the warehouse and inspected all components that could be installed.  Salesperson on site provided us with literature to take home to read.  He made an appoiintment for the coming week and spent a couple of hours going through everything with us and had no hesitation in giving us comments on the for and against various types of components, what they would and wouldn't achieve.  On agreeing to go ahead with his quotation, within a week Western Power had installed a new meter, and several days later the Supervisor arrived with the installers, to inspect where the system would be installed and ensured the electrician knew the earth was an old one and had to be secured properly.  Within 10 days the system was installed.  I was very pleased with the installers, they were very pleasant and cleaned everything up and took all the rubbish away with them.  The Salesperson, Jonathan, rang to see how they went and came around the next day follow up on the installation and to ask if we were happy and if we had any queries.  A truly hassle free and really great installation.",
