      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Installation occurred yesterday, four weeks beyond the agreed date. They suggested I put all 8 panels on a easterly roof, as they didn't want to split the system.They never returned my phone calls, and despite questioning the wisdom of installing on the eastern roof via email, I was extreemly frustrated by their lack of customer service, despite their assurances it was paramount to the provided service.The panels went up yesterday, but is not functioning due to a \"faulty\" inverter. One hopes this is NOT typical of their product. I was assured the company would contact me and arrange a new inverter to be installed. Already I have learnt NOT to \"hold my breath\" with these guys and will probably try and contact them by phone tomorrow.Once receiving my deposit, they have; missed installation date by almost 4 weeks, insisted upon easterly installation despite me continually questioning the efficiency and having had their \"technitians\" confirm a northerly aspect would be far more efficient, (I finally won on having a the system split over two roofs), missed appointments at my home to explain in detail why I couldn't have the split panels on two roofs, and despite being lovely people, seemed to have no idea about installation or basic customer service.I look forward to having a working inverter installed so I can benefit from a solar system.",
